  "contentPreview": "Root cause: the B5 admission path started one timeout stopwatch before in-process gate acquisition, then charged EnsureMaterialized filesystem setup against the remaining lock timeout. Under full-suite I/O load, an unrelated scope could be falsely returned as LockTimeout before its file lock was attempted. Minimal fix: compute the remaining budget immediately after the admission semaphore is acquired, before EnsureMaterialized; the gate wait and file-lock wait remain bounded, while setup is not",
